{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40726","headline":"宿成都松溪院 · 李洞","name":"宿成都松溪院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松持节操溪澄性，一炷烟岚压寺隅。\n翡翠鸟飞人不见，琉璃缾贮水疑无。\n夜闻子落真山雨，晓汲波圆入画图。\n尘拥蜀城抽锁後，此中犹梦在江湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}